<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:style="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:style:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:table="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:table:1.0" xmlns:draw="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:drawing:1.0" xmlns:fo="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:xsl-fo-compatible:1.0" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:meta="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:meta:1.0" xmlns:svg="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:svg-compatible:1.0" xmlns:officeooo="http://openoffice.org/2009/office" xmlns:loext="urn:org:documentfoundation:names:experimental:office:xmlns:loext:1.0" office:version="1.3" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text"><office:automatic-styles></office:automatic-styles><office:body><office:text><text:h text:outline-level="1">Maintenance Record</text:h><text:p>Valve inspection completed on 2026-05-14.</text:p><text:tracked-changes><text:changed-region xml:id="ct1"><text:insertion><office:change-info><dc:creator>R. Sample</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-05-14T10:00:00</dc:date></office:change-info><text:p> Replacement gasket fitted.</text:p></text:insertion></text:changed-region></text:tracked-changes><text:p>Valve pressure <text:change-start text:change-id="ct1"/>rose to 18 kPa<text:change-end text:change-id="ct1"/>.</text:p><text:p>Inspect the eastern line.<office:annotation office:name="comment1"><dc:creator>Casey Example</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-05-14T10:30:00</dc:date><text:p>Confirm the gauge serial number.</text:p></office:annotation></text:p><text:p>Safety review<text:note text:note-class="footnote" text:id="fn1"><text:note-citation>1</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p>Pressure was measured with a synthetic test gauge.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note></text:p><text:p>Archive reference<text:note text:note-class="endnote" text:id="en1"><text:note-citation>A</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p>Record generated for CC0 parser fixtures.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note></text:p></office:text></office:body></office:document>